/T (The bulk of operations for A1 Hospitality Group is in the innovative and rich Pacific Northwest Region, as shown right, with a screenshot from a Google My Maps page displaying the locations of all the properties managed by A1 Hospitality on the West Coast. According to Oxford Economics, the GDP growth of the region is expected to outpace the US by 2028. Oxford Economics states that economic growth has been fueled by the sectors of tech and manufacturing corporations that have grown the region to the superb jewel it is known as today. A1 Hospitality takes advantage of this growth by strategically managing its hotels near Portland, Seattle, and Boise, which are some of the largest cities in the region; this gives an opportunity to give travelers high-quality experiences with their properties located in such regions. )
