/E (Later in the week, on January 2nd, Jerry Beach, Vice President of Operations for A1 Hospitality was able to connect. We chose Mr. Beach, given his extensive role in operations throughout the company and his expertise in that area. We were able to send questions and get answers from Mr. Beach. Through this interaction, we wanted to see an overview of the company and if there were any specific areas throughout the business where they could see AI intergration.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
