671 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 372 0 R
/E (Internet Research was an essential aspect of our project. Through this method, we could catch up on trends in adding Artificial Intelligence to the guest experience in a hotel. This was very useful as it gave us background knowledge on examples of what hotels are currently optimizing in terms of AI. As well as the process and hurdles that come with these optimizations. This knowledge also provided our framework for our interviews with Mr. Griffo and Mr. Beach. Our team used a variety of websites, such as SiteMinder, Forbes, and Revine.  Overall, the use of websites through the internet not only solidified our understanding of the use of Artifical Intelligence in hotels. It also additionally provided us with key information on how to set up our strategic plan. Additionally, information on the disadvantages of AI was also a key aspect of the research to see why hotels were not implementing the technology.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
