739 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 375 0 R
/E (The internet provided a vast amount of information and resources on AI and its influence on the hospitality industry. Our team focused on retracting information regarding how hotels currently employ AI in their processes and what is the best way to implement it. We found throughout our research that there were two main distinctions to what AI is used, which were Generative AI and Predictive AI. Generative AI is mainly used to respond to data that has been given. While Predictive AI uses previous patterns from data points to predict future trends. In terms of ways we saw that AI was causing troubles for hoteliers was with the cost, which often is not economical for hoteliers especially medium-sized.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
