/P 375 0 R
/E (Artificial Intelligence brings many different opportunities to A1 Hospitality. However, most solutions are expensive and not economical for hoteliers. A1 Hospitality should use creativity as well with systems that are already economical. The company can utilize chatbots or thermostats that use AI yet bring critical costs down such as labor and energy)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [7]
>>
